WEBVTT

00:06:28.746 --> 00:06:31.288
Why wouldn’t you just diet and exercise?”

00:06:31.288 --> 00:06:33.579
I’m like, “That sounds awful.”

00:06:33.579 --> 00:06:38.329
(Laughter and applause)

00:06:38.663 --> 00:06:41.121
Why wouldn’t I just wear Spanx
and eat what I want?

00:06:41.121 --> 00:06:43.454
I just feel like, YOLO.

00:06:44.371 --> 00:06:45.371
(Laughs)

00:06:45.954 --> 00:06:48.121
The best thing
about my wedding, honestly,

00:06:48.121 --> 00:06:50.913
was that my sister helped me with my vows,

00:06:50.913 --> 00:06:53.746
which was great because
I was very nervous to write my vows.

00:06:53.746 --> 00:06:56.704
My husband wanted us to write our vows
because he has feelings.

00:06:56.704 --> 00:06:57.704
And so --

00:06:57.704 --> 00:06:58.746
(Laughter)

00:06:58.788 --> 00:06:59.788
my sister helped me.

00:06:59.788 --> 00:07:01.413
And I’m very close to my sister,